    {
      "index": 6,
      "className": "section-pricing-questions",
      "id": "questions",
      "texts": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "text-style-label",
          "text": "(06) Questions"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "cls": "questions_heading heading-style-h2",
          "text": "About fees, answered."
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "text-color-tertiary",
          "text": "answered."
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "The questions we hear most once the numbers are on the table. Anything else, ask us directly."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "text-style-link",
          "href": "#talk",
          "text": "ask us directly"
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "How do your fees work?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "How do your fees work?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Monthly work is a fixed fee agreed up front. Projects such as audits and registrations are quoted before we start. We do not bill by the hour."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "Are the fees on this page plus VAT?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Are the fees on this page plus VAT?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Yes. Every fee here is shown before VAT, which is 5% in the UAE and 20% in the UK."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "Are the prices on this page a quote?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Are the prices on this page a quote?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Not yet. They are our standard fees for the plans, projects and extras most clients need. A partner confirms your fee in writing after a 30 minute call."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "What happens if we grow during the year?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "What happens if we grow during the year?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "The extras on this page are priced now, so a second company or a bigger payroll never comes as a surprise. If a bigger plan fits better, we agree it with you before anything changes."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "Can we pay for the year up front?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Can we pay for the year up front?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Yes. Pay yearly and you pay ten months of fees for twelve months of work. The fee is still reviewed with you once a year."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "What is the notice period?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "What is the notice period?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Three months on Essential and Growth, six months on Group. Projects are paid half at the start and half on delivery."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "Why is the audit not part of my plan?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Why is the audit not part of my plan?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Independence rules. We never audit a company whose books we keep. If you need both, we introduce you to an audit firm we trust."
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "cls": "questions_question w-inline-block",
          "href": "#",
          "text": "Can you take over halfway through the year?+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "cls": "questions_question-text heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Can you take over halfway through the year?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "cls": "questions_icon",
          "text": "+"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "cls": "questions_answer-text text-size-regular text-color-secondary",
          "text": "Yes. Most clients join mid year. We rebuild the months before we started, so the year closes on one consistent set of books."
        }
      ],
      "imgs": [],
      "videos": []
    },
    {
